       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UTCSCHEMA4.
       AUTHOR.     W. H. JENKINS.
       INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   08/08/88.
       DATE-COMPILED.  08/08/88.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-S38.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-S38.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS IO-FEEDBACK.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT SOURCE-FILE   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-SOURCE
                   FILE STATUS IS SOURCE-SK.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  SOURCE-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  SOURCE-RECORD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF QDDSSRC.
       01  SOURCE-RECORD-RDF.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(12).
           05  SEQUENCE-NO               PIC X(5).
           05  FORM-TYPE                 PIC X(1).
           05  COMMENT-INDICATOR         PIC X(1).
           05  CONDITIONING              PIC X(9).
           05  NAME-TYPE                 PIC X(1).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(1).
           05  FLD-NAME                  PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER REDEFINES FLD-NAME.
               10  FILLER                PIC X(2).
               10  FLD-NAME-R            PIC X.
               10  FILLER                PIC X(7).
           05  FLD-REFERENCE             PIC X(1).
           05  FLD-LENGTH                PIC ZZZZ9.
           05  FLD-DATA-TYPE             PIC X(1).
           05  FLD-DEC-POS               PIC ZZ.
           05  FLD-USAGE                 PIC X(1).
           05  FLD-LOC.
               10  FLD-LINE              PIC S9(3).
               10  FLD-POS               PIC S9(3).
           05  FLD-FUNCTION              PIC X(36).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS-KEYS.
           03  SOURCE-SK                 PIC X(2)  VALUE ZERO.
       01  SRCSEQ-WS                     PIC S9(4)V9(2) VALUE ZERO.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  DSSSET                      PIC X(10).
       01  DSTYPE                      PIC X.
       01  KEY1                        PIC X(10).
       01  KEY2                        PIC X(10).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DSSSET DSTYPE KEY1 KEY2.
       A-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 000-INIT THRU 000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 900-MAIN THRU 900-EXIT.
           PERFORM 999-EOJ THRU 999-EXIT.
       COBOL-EXIT.
           EXIT PROGRAM.
       RPG-CL-EXIT.
           STOP RUN.

       000-INIT.
           OPEN OUTPUT SOURCE-FILE.
           MOVE ZERO   TO SRCSEQ-WS.
       000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       600-INIT-SOURCE.
           ADD  +1     TO SRCSEQ-WS.
           MOVE SRCSEQ-WS TO SRCSEQ.
           MOVE ZERO   TO SRCDAT.
           MOVE SPACES TO SRCDTA.
           MOVE "A"    TO FORM-TYPE.
       600-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       900-MAIN.
           IF DSTYPE NOT = "D"
              PERFORM 600-INIT-SOURCE THRU 600-EXIT
              MOVE "UNIQUE"  TO FLD-FUNCTION
              WRITE SOURCE-RECORD.
           PERFORM 600-INIT-SOURCE THRU 600-EXIT.
           MOVE DSSSET    TO FLD-NAME.
           MOVE "R"       TO NAME-TYPE
                             FLD-NAME-R.
           STRING "PFILE("  DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  DSSSET  DELIMITED BY SPACES
                  ")"     DELIMITED BY SIZE
             INTO FLD-FUNCTION.
           WRITE SOURCE-RECORD.
           PERFORM 600-INIT-SOURCE THRU 600-EXIT.
           MOVE KEY1      TO FLD-NAME.
           MOVE "K"       TO NAME-TYPE.
           WRITE SOURCE-RECORD.
           IF KEY2 NOT = SPACES
             AND DSTYPE = "D"
              PERFORM 600-INIT-SOURCE THRU 600-EXIT
              MOVE KEY2      TO FLD-NAME
              MOVE "K"       TO NAME-TYPE
              WRITE SOURCE-RECORD.
       900-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       999-EOJ.
           CLOSE SOURCE-FILE.
       999-EXIT.
           EXIT.
